    <string name="tutorial_subtitle">FOUR RULES OF THE RIVER</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step">STEP %1$d</string>
    <string name="tutorial_1_title">TAP TWO POSTS</string>
    <string name="tutorial_1_body">Tap one lantern post, then another. A bamboo plank snaps between them when they are close enough.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_title">PLANKS ARE LIMITED</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_body">Every crossing has a plank budget. Planks you do not spend turn into stars at the end of the run.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_title">LONG SPANS SAG</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_body">A plank bends under the cart. Over 240 units of load it groans once and then snaps.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_title">HEAVIER CARTS LATER</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_body">Each district rolls a heavier cart, so the safe span gets shorter the further upriver you build.</string>

